Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:12:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/30] server: stream: true on /v1/audio/speech sends raw PCM
 chunks as they are decoded

With stream: true and response_format pcm, the route sends HTTP/1.1 chunks as the engine publishes audio. A stream
that fails after its first chunk ends without a terminator, so a client cannot mistake it for complete audio.
